Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:10.83,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:19.01,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:22.95,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.44,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:29.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:32.83,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 空...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:37.86,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小小？空？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.47,0:00:43.54,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:50.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 久等了... 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:57.17,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:07.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小鸟 你有看到什么人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}折翼的鸟 与奇异的少年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,发生了这样的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:56.90,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶 肯定是扶着家具站起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.00,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,自己去拿了玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.23,0:03:02.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.13,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:09.54,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,渐渐地能够独自做到各种事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:14.70,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要多留意多留神 不能再发生类似的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.31,0:03:17.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我感觉房间里有人...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:18.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:20.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这就不清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.13,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是错觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:24.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太有意思了... 嘻嘻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:27.02,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴也太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:31.31,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,居然问小鸟"你有看到什么人吗？"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:36.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈... 在蓝天大地有着会说话的鸟 就脱口而出了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:36.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(690,970)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:37.91,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:42.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的世界那边 人类和鸟相处地很融洽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:47.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能载着人飞行 会帮忙运输物品
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:51.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,还有着从事模特儿职业的鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:55.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至有在王城里工作的鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:59.52,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 再次刷新了我的认识
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:03.18,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴真是来自一个奇幻的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.83,0:04:07.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,“叮”地一下 就能完成这样的美食
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:10.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,这里才更奇幻啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:14.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咖辣饭最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:16.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是咖喱饭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:17.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:20.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是辣的 为什么要叫喱啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:25.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不是因为辣啊 随便一提 咖喱里也有使用鱼的品种哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:27.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是辣的鱼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:30.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是一种清淡中会呈现出丝丝清甜的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:38.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,作业做好了！书包整理好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:41.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,最后 呼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.82,0:04:46.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,去跟真白同学 说一声 晚 安 做 个 好 梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.25,0:04:57.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 吵醒你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.12,0:05:03.56,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点担心 所以来看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:06.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:08.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.55,0:05:12.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你谁啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我... 我是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:16.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小偷 人贩子 还是...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:19.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！是和卡疤痛一伙的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.69,0:05:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.61,0:05:30.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.20,0:05:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（碰撞声！）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:36.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喂... 是什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.05,0:05:39.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我逮到可疑的人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:42.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,白天偷摸进来的人 肯定就是这个男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,男人？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:45.70,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:52.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴妹妹 你先放开他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:54.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可... 可是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:05:58.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.43,0:06:02.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫翼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:08.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟... 在说话！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:12.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能够说话 还能够变身成人类的小鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:17.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你莫非是蓝天大地的(肉)嘟嘟鸟族？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.47,0:06:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一年多前 我掉落到了这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.55,0:06:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在哪里...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是天窗市
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.69,0:06:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是与蓝天大地相邻的另一个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你多休息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:07:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当发生强烈的风暴时 世界的接合部就会产生裂缝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地和这里会打开一个极短暂的通道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.50,0:07:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每当这个时候 蓝天大地被卷入裂缝的事物 都会掉到这座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.39,0:07:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具体原因还没研究清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天窗市就是这样一个城市
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:26.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那天开始 我就一直受到由由阿姨的照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.60,0:07:31.78,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,一年前 正好是我搬到这里的时间吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:34.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直都装成普通的鸟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:35.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算我开口 你也不会相信的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:40.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暂停！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:45.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,变了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.51,0:07:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一旦受到惊吓 就控制不住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:49.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的啊 奇幻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:51.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你别岔开话题！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:57.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在我和小空来到这里后 经常会讨论关于蓝天大地的事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:00.95,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你却一直保持沉默 给我个理由！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:02.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是...因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.63,0:08:06.21,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小晴你的表情好吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:07.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,汪！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:10.55,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 阿翼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:16.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,让奶奶帮你打开通道的话 早就能回到蓝天大地的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:23.78,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 不能让无法信任的人 逗留在小空的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:25.86,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我要一个能够接受的理由！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:34.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你够了没有！到底在隐瞒什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.24,0:08:38.63,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小... 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:39.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.03,0:08:42.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.73,0:08:51.03,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呼哇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好 真白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:55.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:58.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？小晴人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:09:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说今天请假
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:02.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像一宿都没睡 一直守着小空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:11.07,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 可是阿翼他看起来 并不像是坏孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴妹妹心里应该也清楚的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:14.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,那为什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:16.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是害怕了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:18.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:21.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,他真是卡疤痛同伙的话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:25.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空现在早就被拐走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:28.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不成熟！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:33.51,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:39.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘘！嘘...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:49.36,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:51.62,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:52.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持安静
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:10:00.87,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.15,0:10:07.19,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:08.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.74,0:10:10.73,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:12.64,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:15.14,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.31,0:10:25.38,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:32.87,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:37.56,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:38.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(550,1060)}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1450,1060)}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:57.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你好努力！坚持到底了！太了不起了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.83,0:11:00.32,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:03.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.95,0:11:15.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯丽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:16.77,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能跟我来一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:24.09,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:31.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都锁着 我还以为是空房间...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我给小翼弟弟准备的研究室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.01,0:11:36.40,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,研究？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,航空力学
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}《简单易懂的航空力学》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,航空？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:44.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴妹妹知道飞机的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.03,0:11:45.71,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:48.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在电视里到是见到过...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,航空力学就是研究让飞机飞起来的一门学问
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,风向 强度 机翼的角度
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:12:00.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这边世界的人们 为了能够飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:03.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花了很长时间 总结出来的学问
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我花了一年的时间来学习
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我至今还没回蓝天大地的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.05,0:12:12.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要学习这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:16.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先跟我保证一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:18.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.56,0:12:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听了真正的理由 不许笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:25.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:27.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要飞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要飞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.47,0:12:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜呼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.99,0:13:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能在王都开展览会 这位乘客是那什么的画家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是些卖不出去的画罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:11.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们嘟嘟鸟族真是了不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.42,0:13:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够变身成人类 还会艺术 明明是鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我们飞不起来 明明是鸟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.62,0:13:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天生我材 各有所长嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:24.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.37,0:13:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们嘟嘟鸟族 是世间罕见的不会飞的鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:58.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,据说是很久以前用飞行能力 交换了能够变身成人类的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊... 大事不好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位乘客！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呜...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.33,0:14:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.89,0:14:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:15:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天 飞行这个梦想扎根在了我的心里 可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘟嘟鸟族是不能飞的鸟吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就要从眼睛里射出光线
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.04,0:15:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你问我是怎么飞起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.47,0:15:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸只是拼了命要救你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认真地回想一下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:21.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这辈子都不想再上天了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼啊 作业做完了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.55,0:15:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那天起 我坚持练习飞行 可是完全没效果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.15,0:15:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在风暴来临的那晚 我认为只要顺着强风 就能够飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就一个人上了悬崖...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.53,0:15:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.28,0:15:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是掉了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这一切都没有白费
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.63,0:15:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然掉了下来 却来到了这边世界 学习到了能够飞行的学问
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.69,0:15:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要掌握知识 正确判断风的流向
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能也能飞起来...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.01,0:16:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是会笑的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我不想说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才一直装成普通的鸟...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:17.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太帅了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.77,0:16:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:23.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦下定决心 就要永不言弃 这才是英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不笑话我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:26.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:29.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我想要成为英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:31.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼你想要飞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.48,0:16:34.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然目标不同 但我们都在追求梦想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:36.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我误会你了 对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.77,0:16:40.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,请和我交个朋友吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:45.07,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:02.75,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴 没出状况吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.05,0:17:07.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在说“最强的健康优良儿居然请假了”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:08.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,内心都动摇了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.90,0:17:11.19,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,学校里引发了小惊慌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:13.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好帅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我玩 给我玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.75,0:17:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个一个来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:24.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,一个一个来是吧 那就从强者开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:29.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:33.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是宝宝蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:35.69,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:38.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.27,0:17:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:42.11,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.29,0:17:45.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼是保护小空的骑士呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骑士也太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:48.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:49.49,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:50.89,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（噪音...）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:53.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:58.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！快出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:01.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快现身 我们分个高下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:04.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的话... 我按
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:09.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:14.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈！各位跟我一起高呼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.50,0:18:15.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,预备
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:17.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,老子强炸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.53,0:18:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种形状的东西居然能飞...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太扯了！从航空力学的角度来讲是不可能的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:27.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是说这个的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:29.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 抱歉 我忍不住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:32.51,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 小空麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:34.08,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:36.25,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,很危险的 你留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:37.91,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心一点！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:40.56,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:42.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:45.14,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
